  "summary": "PDP – Slide Out – EU Environmental Qualities",
  "description": "**As a** Shopper, \n\n**I want** to see environmental qualities information for a product on the PDP, \n\n**so that** I can make informed purchasing decisions in line with EU product transparency requirements.\n\n----\n\nThe PDP displays an Environmental Qualities accordion tab on the EU storefront - specifically today for the locales en-FR and fr-FR (please note: en_FR locale replaces today’s magento locale of en-EU because of a technical limitation - see [SFCC-151](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-151) )\n\nThe tab must only render when the `environmentalNotes` attribute is populated on the product in SFCC (sourced from AP21 via MuleSoft). If not relevant for the locale, the tab must be entirely suppressed — no empty state, placeholder, or generic copy may be shown. Content is authored upstream in AP21 by the Zimmermann merchandising team coming into SFCC via MuleSoft. This story covers conditional render logic and data binding only. Dependent on [SFCC-26](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-26) for creating the attribute.",
