    "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
    "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
    "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
  },
  "created": "2026-08-19T15:09:43.491+1000",
  "updated": "2026-09-14T18:03:40.892+1000",
  "comments": [
    {
      "id": "13918",
      "body": "User:712020:4ec4770e-9470-4885-9753-69a36b6cf950 I quickly drafted this story up to cover the backend configuration needed to show the environmental qualities on a PDP. You asked if we could set a default value - would this default be per storefront or per locale as well? \ncc: User:557058:09af9e5b-661b-42a2-90ec-9ce9f69d324d",
