      "body": "User:712020:4ec4770e-9470-4885-9753-69a36b6cf950 Hi Dani, the team is building out these environmental notes at the moment. Do we have a sample value for environmental notes used in en-eu and fr-eu (`en-FR` and `fr-FR`) today?",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
