      "id": "14443",
      "body": "pr raised [https://github.com/ZimmermannAU/zimmermann-sfcc/pull/39](https://github.com/ZimmermannAU/zimmermann-sfcc/pull/39)  User:557058:09af9e5b-661b-42a2-90ec-9ce9f69d324d  for your approval and review.",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Gideon R. Linsangan",
        "name": "Gideon R. Linsangan",
        "email": "gideon.r.linsangan@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/e4458ee16511f43322ad20e3d46ffe2a?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FGL-6.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-09-07T16:41:57.229+1000",
      "updated": "2026-09-07T16:41:57.229+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14498",
      "body": "User:5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d Here is an example of product-specific notes on a product…..\n\\*\\*Fabric Origins:\\*\\*\n- \\*\\*Manufacturing: Italy\\*\\*\n- \\*\\*Colouration: Italy\\*\\*\n\\*\\*For packaging details, see our page relating to the qualities and environmental characteristics:\\*\\* [\\*\\*Packaging\\*\\*](https://www.zimmermann.com/sustainability-how-to-recycle-packaging)\nAnd here is an example of the generic fallback copy when we don’t have specifics:\n\\*\\*For product details, full information will be published shortly. If you have questions in the meantime, please contact our client services team and we would be happy to help.\\*\\*\n\\*\\*For packaging details, see our page relating to the qualities and environmental characteristics:\\*\\* [\\*\\*Packaging\\*\\*](https://www.zimmermann.com/en-eu/accessories/plume-pave-studs-gold-red.html)",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Dani Rivett",
        "name": "Dani Rivett",
        "email": null,
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/42d3d7910c25b8f4ba9e46aabfc6c149?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FDR-3.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-09-08T13:34:39.513+1000",
      "updated": "2026-09-08T13:34:39.513+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14622",
      "body": "User:712020:4e03c03b-a234-479e-a4a8-d95062d39086 User:5f506d223e9e2e004d7c48ac deployed to test",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Victor T. Crisostomo",
        "name": "Victor T. Crisostomo",
        "email": "victor.t.crisostomo@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/557058:09af9e5b-661b-42a2-90ec-9ce9f69d324d/0ead87b0-7d31-4296-b27b-4a7b26ac2af1/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-09-11T20:35:06.378+1000",
      "updated": "2026-09-11T20:35:06.378+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14676",
      "body": "Test Execution update in Test environment:\n\nPassed - 3\n\nDeprecated - 3 (will be tested in SFCC-286)\n\nMoving this ticket now to Ready for SIT",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jesse C. Pagaduan",
        "name": "Jesse C. Pagaduan",
        "email": "jesse.c.pagaduan@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/addd66eb2f0ccf5b562d71afacdacfc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJP-4.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-09-14T17:09:43.103+1000",
      "updated": "2026-09-14T18:03:33.220+1000"
    }
  ]
}"}

