{"result":"{
  "id": "17852",
  "key": "SFCC-26",
  "summary": "Product Attributes – PDP",
  "description": "\\*\\*As a\\*\\* Site Admin,\n\\*\\*I want\\*\\* the product attributes required to render the PDP defined and configured in SFCC Business Manager,\n\\*\\*so that\\*\\* the PDP build can proceed against a stable attribute schema before the full attribute set is finalised.\n----\nThis story scopes attribute definition to the subset needed for the Product Detail Page. It is intentionally limited — attributes required for other surfaces (PLP filtering, integrations, pricing) will be covered in follow-on stories. These attributes must be in place before PDP UI development begins.\n\\*\\*Attributes in scope for this story:\\*\\*\n|\\*\\*Attribute Id\\*\\*|\\*\\*Description\\*\\*|\\*\\*Sample\\*\\*|\n|---|---|---|\n|`ID`|This attribute can be the master product id / variant product id. The master product id, which is the stylecode, is displayed on the PDP.|4673TS251 / 4673TS251GVSCP0P|\n|`styleNumber`|This attribute is always the master product id, whereas the product-id attribute can also contain the colour variant or size variant ID|4673TS251|\n|`name`|This is the product name|Illuminate Fitted Blouse|\n|`longDescription`|This is needed for the long description that is available in the Details & Care tab. In the PDP, the first part of the text is a paragraph - and then the following text is in bullet points.|Crafted from lightweight silk organza, an ornamental print follows the fluid lines of the silhouette in warm, earthy hues. A round neckline meets a sleek bodice, dropping into a voluminous, full-flare skirt. Soft movement flows through the skirt with every step. First seen on our Cruise 2027 Runway.  \n\n* Silk fabrication\n* Mid-length, sleeveless gown\n* Round neckline\n* Full-flare, tulle backed skirt\n* Invisible centre back zip at neck\n* Side seam pockets\n* Comes with a separate jersey slip\n* Cruise 2027 Collection\n\n|\n|`shortDescription`|This is needed for the short description that is directly available on the PDP.|A dramatic drop-waist skirt lends fluid, voluminous movement in silk.|\n|`onlineFlag`|This is the attribute needed for enabling or disabling a product on the site.|Enabled|\n|`onlineFrom`|This is the date from which the product should be enabled on the site given online-flag is set to Enabled.|28-07-2026|\n|`onlineTo`|This is the end date to which the product should be enabled on the site given online-flag is set to Enabled.|01-11-2026|\n|`refinementColor`|This is the displayable colour name.|Guava Seascape|\n|`size`|Size on variant level|XS|\n|`careInstructions`|This is needed for the description that is available on the Care tab.|Main and bodice lining: 100% silk\nDry clean only code f (hydrocarbon only);\nRemove any detachable trims prior to dry cleaning;\nCover to protect trim;\nIron in low temperature with protective cloth;\nLight steam only;\nDo not spot clean|\n|`sizeFit`|This attribute is for displaying the size and fit on the Size & Fit tab.|Indra Plunge Halter Maxi Dress is crafted in a structured, heavyweight fabric with no stretch, this dress holds its shape beautifully. Fits true to size.|\n|`modelFit`|This attribute is for displaying the model and sizing text directly on the PDP|Model is 5’10” Tall/177 cm and is wearing a US Size 6, runs true to size.|\n|`environmentalNotes`|This attribute is for displaying the environmental notes if applicable on the Environmental Qualities tab|Fabric Origins:\n- Weaving/Knitting: China\n- Dyeing/Printing: China\n- Manufacturing: Sri Lanka\nFor packaging details, see our page relating to the qualities and environmental characteristics: [Packaging](https://www.zimmermann.com/sustainability-how-to-recycle-packaging)|\n|`outOfStockStatus`|This attribute is used to display Back in Soon / Coming Soon / Unavailable in PDP.|Back in Soon|\n|`outOfStockStatusStartDate`|This attribute is used to give a start date on the display of Back in Soon / Coming Soon in PDP.|28-07-2026|\n|`outOfStockStatusEndDate`|This attribute is used to give an end date on the display of Back in Soon / Coming Soon in PDP.|07-08-2026|",
