      "body": "Hello User:5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d \n\nAs discussed, the **Attributes in Scope** table for this story only needs to include the **Attribute ID**, **Description**, and **SFCC Type**. Could you please update the table to align with the SFCC format?\n\nUpon reviewing the provided table, we noted that the **Attribute Name** does not follow a consistent naming convention, such as camelCase, hyphenated-case, or Title Case.\n\nThank you so much.",
