  "key": "SFCC-266",
  "summary": "PDP – Slide Out – EU Environmental Qualities",
  "customfield_10231": {
    "value": "1. Given a shopper is on the PDP on the EU Domestic storefront (only for locales en_FR or fr_FR locales), when the product has a non-empty environmentalNotes attribute, then the Environmental Qualities link is displayed on the PDP.\n2. Given a shopper is on the PDP on the EU Domestic storefront (only for locales en_FR or fr_FR locales), when the product has an empty or absent environmentalNotes attribute, then the Default Environmental Qualities of that storefront are shown.\n3. Given a shopper is on the PDP on any non-EU storefront (AU, US, UK, HK, ME), when the page loads, then the Environmental Qualities link does not render, regardless of whether environmentalNotes is populated on the product.\n4. Given the Environmental Qualities link is visible, when a shopper expands it, then the content displayed reflects the value of environmentalNotes coming from the product attribute.\n5. Given the drawer tab order is rendered, when the Environmental Qualities tab is present, then it appears after the standard tabs (Details & Care, Size & Fit, Shipping & Returns, Assistance)."
  }
}"}

